      <li><span class="timeline-share">20%</span><span class="timeline-date">Jul 1<span>2027</span></span><strong data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</strong></li>
      <li><span class="timeline-share">20%</span><span class="timeline-date">Oct 1<span>2027</span></span><strong data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</strong></li>
    </ol>
  </figure>
</div><div class="payment-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">The payment plan</p><h3>20% now.<br>The journey ahead.</h3><p>Secure your spot with a <strong id="deposit-amount">$3,285.80</strong> deposit when reservations open.</p><ol class="payment-dates"><li><span>On reservation</span><strong>20% deposit</strong></li><li><span>January 1, 2027</span><strong>20% · <span data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</span></strong></li><li><span>April 1, 2027</span><strong>20% · <span data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</span></strong></li><li><span>July 1, 2027</span><strong>20% · <span data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</span></strong></li><li><span>October 1, 2027</span><strong>20% · <span data-installment-amount>$3,285.80</span></strong></li></ol><p class="fine">Five equal payments of 20%, including your reservation deposit.</p></article><article class="pay-in-full"><p class="eyebrow">Pay in full · Save 5% with bitcoin</p><h3>One payment.<br>All set for adventure.</h3><p>Pay for your entire trip at signup <strong>with bitcoin to save 5%</strong> on your berth fare. Payments through Stripe are charged the standard fare.</p><dl class="full-payment-summary"><div><dt>Pay in full via Stripe</dt><dd id="full-standard-price">{{ (index .Berths 0).Price }}</dd></div><div><dt>Bitcoin savings · 5%</dt><dd id="full-savings">{{ (index .Berths 0).PayInFullSavings }}</dd></div><div class="full-payment-total"><dt>Pay in full with bitcoin</dt><dd id="full-payment-amount">{{ (index .Berths 0).PayInFull }}</dd></div></dl><p class="fine">USD per person for the selected berth, due at signup. The 5% discount applies only to full payment in bitcoin at signup. Your fare is paid in full, with no scheduled installments. Inclusions, tax treatment, and booking terms are being finalized.</p></article></div><div class="booking-note"><strong>Reservations opening soon.</strong><span>Payment options are a preview. No deposit or payment is collected on this page.</span></div></section>
<section id="booking-terms" class="section booking-terms" aria-labelledby="booking-terms-heading">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Before you book</p><h2 id="booking-terms-heading">Your passage.<br>The details.</h2><p>Booking information preview. Final terms will be available to review before reservations open.</p></div>
  <div class="booking-terms-grid">
    <article><h3>Your berth</h3><p>Fares are in USD, per person, for the January 24–February 5, 2028 expedition. Reserve spots for your group, then arrange them across cabin types. Request an M, F or co-ed roommate for an unfilled twin cabin; triple and quad cabins default to co-ed. We’ll try to match preferences, but cannot guarantee them.</p><p>A group booking covers the selected number of passengers. Choose your group’s cabin arrangements during checkout. Cabin numbers and deck locations are not guaranteed.</p></article>
    <article><h3>Your payment plan</h3><p>Choose five payments of 20%, or pay in full at signup. Only full payment in bitcoin qualifies for the 5% discount. Stripe payments use the standard fare.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="#payment-options">Review amounts and payment dates ↑</a></p></article>
    <article><h3>Changes &amp; cancellations</h3><p>Cancellation charges, refund terms, passenger substitutions and missed-payment terms are being finalized. These will be shown before you are asked to pay.</p><p>No cancellation policy is in effect for this preview, and no booking is made here.</p></article>
    <article><h3>Before you confirm</h3><p>You will be able to review your berth, total fare, payment schedule, inclusions and exclusions, and the final booking and traveler requirements together before agreeing.</p><p>Reservations remain closed while these details are finalized.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
